# Timetwister: each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library and draws seven. Black Lotus, sacrificed
# for its mana, is in Bot1's graveyard and goes back into the library; Timetwister, still on the stack, is put into the
# graveyard afterwards (CR 608.2n) and stays there. Both players hold seven cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Timetwister
Island x5
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Timetwister.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Timetwister
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
